上添加一只彩色鹦鹉，鹦鹉正惬意地待在她的肩膀上.\n\n●双图编辑\n▷将图1角色的衣服替换为图2的衣服。\n▷将图2人物的头部替换到图1的头部，衣服与图1保持一致。\n▷生成一张这位亚洲女性和她的地精好友一起在酒吧的图片，他们在吧台拿着啤酒，电影感摄影。\n\n●人物场景编辑时：图像-1上传场景，图像-2上传人物\n\n●局部重绘/移除【需要编辑遮罩】\n▷移除蓝色区域，并在该区域生成一个瓦力机器人。\n▷移除蓝色区域，画面其余部分与原图保持一致。\n\n●图像扩展【需要打开开关】\n▷移除蓝色区域，画面其余部分与原图保持一致。\n\n\n●提示词技巧\n▷尽量不说“不...” 错误案例：保持xxx不变，不要改变xxx\n▷正确说法为肯定式，正确案例：保持xxx与xxx一致，保留xxx\n\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [377.6072692871094, 510.3687438964844], "pos": [-1304.6492919921875, 384.0878601074219], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [34], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [462.0907897949219, 349.9651794433594], "pos": [-800.3046875, 435.34698486328125], "widgets_values": ["将图1角色的衣服替换为图2的女性"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.16.3", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "links": [], "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [883.85107421875, 733.238037109375], "pos": [2430.904541015625, 545.6287841796875], "widgets_values": ["krea2_identity_edit"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 10, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix",